  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read the task-011 engine contract + `IAssociationRung`/`RungMatch`; read the current `QueryContactByEmailAsync` to see the existing contact-resolution path.</step>
    <step order="2">Read the W0 task-004 catalog/priority extension confirming `sprk_organization` (+ `sprk_event`) targets are wired; confirm `sprk_regardingorganization` is the correct field.</step>
    <step order="3">Read `.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md` §F + ADR-024 before writing rung output.</step>
    <step order="4">Extend `QueryContactByEmailAsync` (or add a focused query alongside it) to resolve, for a participant email: (a) matched contact(s), (b) memberships — matter contact, project team member, counsel; and add org-by-domain resolution mapping sender domain → `sprk_organization`.</step>
    <step order="5">Implement `ParticipantCorrelationRung` (rung 2): iterate `from`/`to[]`/`cc[]`; for each, run the extended query; emit `RungMatch` results (matter/project/counsel-contact/organization targets) in the 0.60–0.85 band with provenance citing participant + membership/domain rule. Ensure org matches target `sprk_organization` via `sprk_regardingorganization`.</step>
    <step order="6">Register the rung in `CommunicationModule` after rungs 0/1, before rung 3.</step>
    <step order="7">Write per-rung unit tests + direction-symmetry tests + an explicit test asserting the org match writes `sprk_regardingorganization`→`sprk_organization` and NEVER `account`. Coordinate suite scope with task 017.</step>
    <step order="8">Run `dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/` + `dotnet test tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/ --filter Communication`; confirm task-011 characterization tests still pass.</step>
    <step order="8.1">Run `dotnet publish -c Release src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ -o c:/tmp/r4-013-publish/`; report compressed size + delta vs ~49.63 MB baseline. Expected ≈ 0.</step>
    <step order="8.2">Run `dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive` — confirm no new HIGH-severity CVEs.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` on the diff; `adr-check` against `spec.md` (focus FR-10 rung 2 + FR-04 org target + ADR-024). Address Critical findings; cite bff-extensions Placement Justification.</step>
    <step order="10">Run `/conflict-check` before the PR (BFF hot-path; 012/014 are parallel siblings — confirm no overlapping engine-file edits).</step>
    <step order="11">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (013 ✅) + `current-task.md`; record decisions (membership query shape, domain-match rules, org-target verification).</step>
  </steps>

