    <criterion testable="true">Sender email domain resolves to `sprk_organization` via `sprk_regardingorganization`; a test asserts NO path writes `account` for org association (FR-04/DEC-3).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`QueryContactByEmailAsync` is extended (not forked) to resolve membership + org-by-domain.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Rung-2 matches land in the 0.60–0.85 confidence band.</criterion>
