  <notes>
    Parallel sibling of 012 (rungs 0/1) and 014 (rung 3). Keep the rung in its own `Engine/Rungs/*` file; the only shared file touched is `IncomingAssociationResolver.cs` (`QueryContactByEmailAsync`) + `CommunicationModule.cs` — coordinate edits with siblings via `/conflict-check`.

    The `sprk_organization`-not-`account` correction is a named correctness goal (DEC-3/FR-04); the dedicated assertion test is the guard against regressing the current buggy `account` write.

    Task 015 consumes these `RungMatch` results; conflicting high-confidence rung-2 org vs rung-1 matter matches feed the `Ambiguous` status logic in 015.
